    Fix iteration 9 — footprint-aware occupancy:
    - When a block is stamped, ALL grid cells it physically occupies are marked,
      not just its center cell. Size read from model PrimaryPart or first BasePart.
    - This means a block sitting flush against a 4x4x4 block actually finds an
